text:
【英文原文節錄：完整 Claim 1；非整份專利全文，其他請求項、說明書與圖式請核對來源。不得由本節未記載推定整份專利不存在該特徵。】
1. A method of controlling a fan speed for a battery unit, the method comprising:
determining power discharge and a current temperature of the battery unit;
 obtaining a relationship between fan speed of a fan for the battery unit and temperature of the battery unit based on the power discharge and the current temperature of the battery unit;
 identifying, by a processing device, a minimum fan speed based on the relationship between fan speed and temperature and a maximum operating temperature of the battery unit; and
 controlling the fan by setting the speed of the fan to the minimum fan speed.

